This directory is empty on purpose, and tracked on purpose.

.wp-env.json maps it to wp-content/plugins/emposo-local for local plugin
experiments, and phpcs.xml.dist scans it so anything dropped here is held to
the same standards as the rest of the codebase. Neither survives the directory
not existing: a fresh clone had no plugins/, so phpcs exited 3 with `The file
"plugins" does not exist` — and CI reported that as a pass.

The site itself ships zero front-end plugins; see the plan's risk 3.
